        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5050LSKN Knurled Lever with Square Rose and Stem, Exterior Only</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is exterior rose and lever replacement trim only.  It does not include interior trim,  latch, or strike.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSKN-specifications.gif?v=1704354573\" width=\"600\" height=\"149\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Knurled Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Knurled T-Bar Leverset with Square Rose, Exterior Replacement Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSKN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262373\"><b>Emtek Knurled Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Exterior Replacement Trim Includes: 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> Exterior Replacement Trim Includes: 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bed or Bath):</b> Exterior Replacement Trim Includes: 1 lever and 1 rose with emergency release trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-6-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354631\" width=\"512\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
